@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Several --ignore-path values are all applied, and a missing ignore file is skipped (tests/integration/__tests__/ignore-path.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 The --help output names the option as accepting several values with the default [.prettierignore] (tests/integration/__tests__/__snapshots__/help-options.js.snap) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Make --ignore-path an array option with the default [".prettierignore"] (src/cli/cli-options.evaluate.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Build one matcher per ignore file and treat a path as ignored when any matcher ignores it (src/utils/ignore.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Accept a single ignorePath or a list in getFileInfo (src/common/get-file-info.js, src/index.d.ts)
+- [ ] 2.4 Docs and changelog (docs/cli.md, docs/api.md, changelog_unreleased/cli/14332.md)
